      "text": "Yes, dear.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/005_penny_cc0fad32cda_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.929,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "sourceEntry": 771,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "Looking at her hand of cards",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/006_director_87d70f337ac_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.118,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "sourceEntry": 771,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Darling, it will be fine. Don’t you worry. I’ve given myself a terrible hand.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/007_penny_d85ac16b52d_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 5.108,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "sourceEntry": 772,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "If we’d had the usual spot this wouldn’t have happened.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/008_parkes_f816af46e6a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.647,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "sourceEntry": 773,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "MONICA glares at him, but restrains herself from speaking.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/009_director_60f5287deb8_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.984,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "sourceEntry": 773,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "No, dear.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/010_penny_12c71340e22_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.836,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "sourceEntry": 774,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "It’s sheltered over at that other spot.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/011_parkes_a2e90f6056f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.043,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "sourceEntry": 775,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Yes. So you’ve told us. Many times.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/012_monica_81efa209a79_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.95,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "sourceEntry": 776,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "PENNY looks at her warningly.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/013_director_76d0d3b1fa1_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.055,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "sourceEntry": 776,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Five days of rain. Would you believe it? The perfect summer holiday.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/014_parkes_8a06ee48b12_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.669,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "sourceEntry": 777,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I think you’ll find it’s six.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/015_monica_527ca2c09d8_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.718,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "sourceEntry": 778,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "counts on fingers",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/016_director_1e978539834_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.782,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "sourceEntry": 778,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You’re right. Six.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/017_parkes_e759e66d30c_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.718,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "sourceEntry": 779,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Perhaps if you look you’ll find another drip.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/018_monica_a64c6746a4c_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.137,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "sourceEntry": 780,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Are you being sarcastic?",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/019_parkes_bf58f284266_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.393,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "sourceEntry": 781,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "all sweetness",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/020_director_f281f08b95a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.808,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "sourceEntry": 781,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken_parse_wrap_fix",
      "text": "Darling Parkes, would I be sarcastic? When you’ve gone to so much trouble, and put me in this lovely caravan and dragged me off into the bush on this lovely holiday in the rain?",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/021_monica_fcc504b9eba_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 11.331,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "sourceEntry": 782,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "It’s not my fault it rained.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/022_parkes_eafd3c991c4_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.579,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "sourceEntry": 783,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "very brightly",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/023_director_0cc1fd9172e_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.618,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "sourceEntry": 783,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’m sure it will stop tomorrow.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/024_penny_544b8e7235f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.765,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "sourceEntry": 784,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "If you say that once more, I’ll strangle you.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/025_monica_93e40e01d5e_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.183,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "sourceEntry": 785,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "PARKES moves to the door. He examines it.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/026_director_dd99112f040_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.654,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 27,
      "sourceEntry": 785,
      "speaker": "PARKES",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Look at that dent! He must have been wearing steel points on his shoes.",
      "src": "audio/pages/49/lines/027_parkes_c3e2b043888_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.715,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Dave - Expressive Australian English"
